==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ar}} {{term|حديث|tr=ħadí:θ|lang=ar||Prophetic tradition}} < {{term|حدث|tr=ħáddaθa|lang=ar||to tell, relate, report}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|pl=hadith|pl2=hadiths}}

# {{Islam}} the [[collected]] [[saying]]s and [[action]]s of [[Muhammad]] and his companions as related by eyewitnesses, used to determine the [[Sunna]] ([[Muslim]] way of life).

